{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1445","id":4009253039,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87u-Fiv","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1445","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1445.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1445.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1445","number":1445,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(method-map): map structured mark-point and worked-solution posture (#1433)","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nImplements #1433 (parent #1427; depends on #1431, #1432).\n\nAdds a checked-in **structured review posture mapping** artifact + validator that maps existing MS `source`/`span`/`raw-item`/`candidate-link` signals into post-attempt review posture, **without overclaiming scoring readiness**.\n\nNew files (narrow, additive only):\n- `scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-structured-review-posture.mjs` — pure resolver, artifact builder, validator, readback\n- `scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-structured-review-posture.test.js` — 19 tests\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-structured-review-posture.{v1.json,validator-result.v1.json,readback.md}`\n\n## What it maps\n\n- **structured_mark_point_status**: `accepted` / `provisional` / `candidate_only` / `missing` / `blocked`\n- **worked_solution_status**: `accepted` / `provisional` / `fallback_explanation` / `missing` / `blocked`\n- **Scoring separation** (independent of structured availability): `scoring_posture`, `point_judgement_allowed`, `authoritative_score_allowed`, optional `scoring_authority_ref`\n- Accepted/provisional/candidate/missing/blocked counts reported separately in the summary.\n\n## Scoring boundary (hard rules enforced)\n\n- Candidate/provenance MS evidence **never** becomes accepted scoring truth.\n- Provisional/candidate content requires **downgraded wording** and cannot support confident final scoring.\n- Accepted structured marks support self-assessment/diagnostics but **do not equal scoring authority**; point-level awarded/missed judgement and authoritative scores require a separate **released** scoring authority (released status + released rubric ref + validated uncertainty posture).\n- Accepted marks without a released authority disallow \"you earned M1\" / \"you scored 3/5\" / \"Cambridge would award\" wording.\n- Missing structured MS still emits a **fallback** review payload and never drops the row.\n- Structured/native display stays primary even when a source screenshot exists.\n\nThis mapping artifact **ships no released scoring authority**, so every checked-in case keeps `authoritative_score_allowed` and `point_judgement_allowed` **false** (`authoritative_score_allowed_count = 0`, no `released_deterministic` posture) and makes **no official scoring or Smart Mark readiness claim**. The resolver still opens deterministic scoring only for a genuine released authority — proven by a unit test, never asserted by the artifact — so the boundary is not merely hardcoded false.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-structured-review-posture.mjs` → `validator_status: pass`, 13/13 checks, `authoritative_score_allowed_count=0`, `point_judgement_allowed_count=0`.\n- Focused suite + post-attempt chain siblings (#1441 schema, #1431 read-model, #1432 rights-gate): **46 tests pass**.\n- ESLint: 0 errors. Report/artifact guard: healthy, 0 violations. A+ ratchet: healthy, 0 warnings.\n\nCloses #1433.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-07-07T19:05:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T19:14:48Z","closed_at":"2026-07-07T19:14:48Z","merged_at":"2026-07-07T19:14:48Z","merge_commit_sha":"132e578c4f5d3a19431e9367a7c09bdd848258e1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1445/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1445/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1445/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/6b7857624560ec9d45403ad93a91ad91481546ef","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1433","ref":"feat/issue-1433","sha":"6b7857624560ec9d45403ad93a91ad91481546ef","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/